%% 死亡通知时序
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client 进程
    participant K as 内核
    participant S as Server 进程

    Note over C: binder.linkToDeath(recipient, 0)
    C->>K: BC_REQUEST_DEATH_NOTIFICATION(handle=42, cookie=&BpBinder)
    K->>K: ref.death = { cookie }

    Note over S: Server 进程崩溃 / 退出
    S--xK: 进程退出, binder_proc 销毁
    K->>K: 遍历 node->refs<br/>找注册了死亡通知的 ref
    K->>C: BR_DEAD_BINDER (cookie = &BpBinder)
    C->>C: BpBinder::sendObituary()<br/>遍历 mObituaries<br/>recipient->binderDied()
    C->>K: BC_DEAD_BINDER_DONE (cookie)
    K->>K: 释放 binder_ref_death
